NOTE ON TRAINING DATA
This licence covers the exported model artifacts and accompanying code only.
The model was trained on FER-2013, which carries its own terms. No dataset
images are distributed here. Users are responsible for compliance with the
FER-2013 licence for any training or redistribution of derived data.

NOTE ON USE
This model estimates facial EXPRESSION. It is not a diagnostic, clinical,
screening, or psychological assessment tool, and must not be used as one.
